you do that too?My human recently played an old game about dogs again. Nintendogs, I think it's called. At first, I was a little jealous that he was playing with other dogs. So I kept insisting that he play fetch with me instead of continuing his game.But that gave him ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:21:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691738","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1844751498232999","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Deck Compatibility","summary":"Hey everyone, here is some info about Steam Deck compatibility for Golden Retriever Simple Life.The game performs well on Steam Deck.You’ll mostly use the touchpad and R2 to navigate.You can also use the touchscreen, it works great too!Touch controls currently don't work for drag-and-drop actions (placing stickers, adjusting option sliders, or shaking the cursor). Use R2 and the touchpad for those.Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T02:53:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232999","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1842846814453519","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Small fix with cursor shaking","summary":"Fixed a bug where moving slowly the mouse cursor to the left would trigger glittering. It now correctly only triggers when shaking the cursor.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T16:22:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453519","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1842846814451365","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"update","title":"Good Boy Diaries #9: Demo Update!","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶My human told me he just finished a new version of the demo, and plenty of new things are now possible!We can now play Tug-of-War with the yellow ring! You can also feint instead of throwing the ball while playing fetch (but don’t overdo it!), and you can shake your paw cursor over me to create funny glitters everywhere! We can also check out the pictures of my friends that we’ve added to Nosebook.Sounds like a lot of fun! I can’t wait to play Tug-of-War with you! I don’t ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T17:36:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451365","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1840944183781019","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #8: Steam Deck - 5,000 Wishlists","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶I hope you had a lot of fun playing with me! I sure did!I think my favorite part was playing fetch in the garden. Or was it the walk in the meadow? Hard to tell…Lately, my human has been playing a lot with a small black box he calls a Steam Deck. He told me that people can now play with me using it, too. Sounds weird to me. That thing is so small, I don’t really see how we’re going to play with it. Maybe he’ll throw it in the backyard, and then I’ll have to fetch it? Could","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T23:39:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781019","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1840944183779362","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes August 14, 2026","summary":"Quality of Life:Volume sliders are now less sensitive. You’ll still hear something by setting the slider half way.Volume settings are now saved, and loaded when you relaunch the game.Pressing ESC now opens or closes the menu on the left.Bug Fixes:Fixed missing text when trying to purchase something while not having enough money (was correct only in French and English)Removed dev tools when pressing F12Fixed black screen when going back to main menu or options when the game is paused.Fixed full s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T11:36:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779362","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1840310314353662","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #7: Demo Available Now!","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶It's finally time to play together!I know I’m a little earlier than planned, but I was just too excited to wait and opened the door all by myself!What are you waiting for? Let's go!Tail wags and nose boops,– Pichu 🐾","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T10:04:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1840310314339657","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #6 - Demo on August 11!","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶I have some great news to share today!The demo my human has been working so hard on will be released on August 11!Well, I’m not exactly sure when that is, but he told me I only have to sleep about 24 more times before it’s out. (I take three naps a day)Anyway, I can’t wait to finally play with all of you!Are you looking forward to it too?What are we going to play first?Thanks for reading! Tail wags and nose boops,– Pichu 🐾","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T16:36:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1835871199313039","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #5 - Summertime & Upcoming Demo","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶Can you believe how fast the white, cold fluffy stuff disappeared? Winter feels like a lifetime ago! Now, the garden is covered in delicious green grass, and my human says it’s finally SUMMER! ☀️From what I’ve gathered, summer means three things:🌳 Extra long walks🎾 Fetch sessions and tunnel exploration in the yard🦋 Chasing those weird, colorful flying bugsAnd I have a big secret to share: my human told me a DEMO is coming soon! I don’t really understand what a \"demo\" is, b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T14:03:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199313039","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1823825466501244","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #4 - Snow Days","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶Something weird happened lately.I went outside on what seemed like a normal day… but everything had turned white!Like… the ground. The trees. Everything.At first, I thought someone had spilled flour everywhere.So I sniffed it… then I put one paw on it… and it was COLD!But it was also super fun! It made little paw prints, it was falling from the sky, and I could run around like a maniac for absolutely no reason (my favorite activity). It was so fun I couldn’t resist rolling","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-07T07:27:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466501244","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1819386365098576","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #3 - Holiday time!","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶Lately, my human won’t stop talking about Christmas. I’m not exactly sure what Christmas is, but it sounds like something really fun! Apparently, there will be presents, and we even brought a tree inside the house, which sounds like a weird but really cool idea to me!We also went to visit a very old human with a big white beard, dressed entirely in red. He was super friendly, and I even got to take a picture with him! I don’t know who he is, but everyone seemed very happy ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-20T18:45:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365098576","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1815580768315741","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #2 - A walk in the forest","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶My human took me to the forest yesterday, and wow, what an adventure! There were red and yellow leaves everywhere on the ground. I ran through them, and they made the funniest crunchy sounds! It was raining a little, but that just made everything smell even better.At some point, we met some really big dogs. Like… bigger than any dog I’ve ever seen! They didn’t bark, but they looked super friendly. My human took a picture of me with them.It was a great day. I can’t wait to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-08T04:37:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768315741","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4096810-1814309641536156","game_id":"steam-4096810","kind":"announcement","title":"Good Boy Diaries #1 - They're Making a Game About Me?!","summary":"Woof! It’s me, Pichu! 🐶My human told me something amazing — he’s making a game about me!I don't quite understand what a \"game\" is, but according to him, it's a special way for us to bond. He mentioned sharing moments like feeding me, going for walks, and playing together. That doesn't just sound fun, it sounds like a perfect day!I’ll be writing these Good Boy Diaries from time to time, where I'll share all my adventures and everything we've been working on. A forest walk is coming up soon! I'm w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-26T11:38:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641536156","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4096810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4096810":"2026-10-26T11:24:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4096810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:11Z"},"4824970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:12Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_ve